    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. that sounds like something people say to make it feel better, but it doesn't feel true. it feels like you're just describing a ghost. a ghost doesn't have \"strength\" or \"resilience,\" it just lingers. it's just a long, quiet, meaningless wait for nothing. there's no plot anymore. there's no point in dragging out a sequel that has no reason to exist. it just feels like a mercy to let things actually be finished.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
